# Adding Verticality

For jumping, use `GetKeyDown` with Space and apply an upward force or velocity:

```csharp
if (Input.GetKeyDown(KeyCode.Space) && isGrounded)
{
    rb.velocity = new Vector3(rb.velocity.x, jumpForce, rb.velocity.z);
    // Or: rb.AddForce(Vector3.up * jumpForce, ForceMode.Impulse);
}
```

Ground detection usually involves a small ground check Raycast or Collider.
